0.01)</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#c5060b\">Error in\r\n  scatter(dapcgenchar, col = rainbow(3), clabel = 0.8, cex = 1.5,  :</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#c5060b\">  object\r\n  &#39;dapcgenchar&#39; not found</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:blue\">&gt; dapcgenchar</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#c5060b\">Error: object\r\n  &#39;dapcgenchar&#39; not found</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:blue\">&gt; dapcgenchar$grp</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#c5060b\">Error: object\r\n  &#39;dapcgenchar&#39; not found</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table><div> Herewith I attach a screens